WHY filter() IS A GOOD FIT
================================================================================

Deletion asks:

"Which records should remain?"


filter() answers exactly that.


Condition:

item.id !== id


means:

KEEP EVERY ITEM
WHOSE ID IS NOT
THE TARGET ID.


